            <fr:title text="Protocol Snarkification">Protocol Snarkification</fr:title>
            <fr:meta name="toc">true</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
    There are ongoing efforts to "snarkify" Ethereum, i.e. to integrate <fr:link href="/dhsorens-001L/" title="Zero Knowledge Proofs" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-001L/" display-uri="dhsorens-001L" type="local">zero knowledge proofs</fr:link> into every layer of the Ethereum protocol. I contribute to this via <fr:link href="/dhsorens-000X/" title="Formal Specification and Verification" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-000X/" display-uri="dhsorens-000X" type="local">formal verification</fr:link> in <fr:link href="/dhsorens-lean/" title="The Lean Theorem Prover" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-lean/" display-uri="dhsorens-lean" type="local">Lean</fr:link>. My main focus is currently on <fr:link href="https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/CompPoly" type="external">CompPoly</fr:link> and <fr:link href="https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib" type="external">Arklib</fr:link>.
</html:p>
            <html:p>
    See <fr:link href="http://verified-zkevm.org/" type="external">our website</fr:link> for more information.
</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
