    During my <fr:link href="/dhsorens-phd/" title="PhD in Formal Methods" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-phd/" display-uri="dhsorens-phd" type="local">PhD</fr:link> and in the years after a lot of time thinking about <fr:link href="/dhsorens-000Y/" title="Smart Contracts" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-000Y/" display-uri="dhsorens-000Y" type="local">smart contract</fr:link> design, specification, and verification.
    
    </html:p>
